      "problem": "Consider a function $f:{R}^{3\\times 2}\\to {R}^{2}$ defined by\n\n$$\nf(A)=[\\begin{aligned}5 & 1 & -2\\end{aligned}]A.\n$$\n\nGiven that ${a}_{ij}$ denotes the entry of $A$ in the intersection of the $i$th row and $j$th column, we have\n\n$\\frac{∂{f}_{1}}{∂{a}_{32}}=${{field-1}}.",
